# Keep every text file checked out with LF so tests and tools behave the same on
# Windows, macOS, and Linux. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites the working
# tree to CRLF on Windows and CRLF-sensitive assertions fail only on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets keep their original bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
